{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國聯邦調查局（FBI）表示，朝鮮國家支持的黑客組織在過去18個月內，通過一套名為「FaceStealer」的複雜社會工程攻擊手段，竊取了價值超過4億美元的加密貨幣。這些攻擊者利用受害者熟悉的人物形象偽造視頻會議，誘騙目標安裝惡意軟件，再通過被入侵的設備和社交關係網絡擴大攻擊範圍。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586222.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:37:10.905162+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:16:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_hash":"974bc78d952402aafa106efe9808ce78979ff63ddec8b96a0be7397927f922f7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}